\b Vinayaka Agencies - Accounting, Billing and Inventory\b0\par
\par
This software was built for Vinayaka Agencies and is installed on computers belonging to that business. Please read the notes below before continuing.\par
\par
\b Where your books are kept\b0\par
Company data - the database, your backups, your logo and your local settings - is stored at:\par
\par
\pard\sa120\li360 C:\\ProgramData\\VinayakaAgencies\par
\pard\sa120
This location is shared by every Windows account on this computer, so whoever signs in opens the same set of books. Uninstalling the software does \b not\b0  delete this folder. Your books and backups stay where they are.\par
\par
\b Backups are your responsibility\b0\par
The software takes verified backups into the \i backups\i0  folder shown above, and can copy each one to a second location such as a network share or an external drive. Until you set that second location, every copy of your books lives on this one computer. Fire, theft or a failed disk would take them with it.\par
\par
If you keep backups on an external drive, encrypt that drive with Windows BitLocker. The database itself is not encrypted: anyone who obtains the file or a backup of it can read your customers, prices and vouchers.\par
\par
\b Statutory records\b0\par
This software keeps an audit trail of every change to a voucher or a master record, recording who made it and when. That trail cannot be switched off by anyone, including the owner, because Rule 3(1) of the Companies (Accounts) Rules does not permit it. Your books must be retained for eight years.\par
\par
\b No warranty\b0\par
The software is provided as it is, without warranty of any kind. It is a tool for keeping records; it is not a substitute for your accountant. Returns, computations and filings remain your responsibility and theirs.\par
\par
Click \b I accept\b0  to continue, or \b Cancel\b0  to stop.\par
